ble. You'll need a copy of the 2e rulebook, and the Pure character creation rules* from either Dark Eras or the Onyx Path dev blogs (here: <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/playing-the-pure-werewolf-the-forsaken/\" target=\"_blank\">http://theonyxpath.com/playing-the-p...-the-forsaken/</a>), and you'll be set.<br /> <br /> * We updated these but aren't reprinting them entirely - word count that we thought would be better served bringing you more goodies!<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Writer. Developer.</i> <b>World of Darkness</b> | <b>Chronicles of Darkness</b> | <b>The Trinity Continuum</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/156-bunyip","name":"Bunyip","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1880"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-03T02:42:39-07:00","id":1251001,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Bunyip</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1131020-night-horrors-shunned-by-the-moon?p=1251000#post1251000\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">There are definitely enough rules for them to be playable. You'll need a copy of the 2e rulebook, and the Pure character creation rules* from either Dark Eras or the Onyx Path dev blogs (here: <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/playing-the-pure-werewolf-the-forsaken/\" target=\"_blank\">http://theonyxpath.com/playing-the-p...-the-forsaken/</a>), and you'll be set.<br /> <br /> * We updated these but aren't reprinting them entirely - word count that we thought would be better served bringing you more goodies!</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> So basically Gifts lists are updated and we will see more merits, and everything could be added to the creation rules from dark eras right?<br /> That's nice.<br /> Can't wait to see the art notes from Mike and start to work on them.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#800000\">-'' </span>We are the unsullied.<br /> We are the inheritors.<br /> We are the Pure <span style=\"color:#800000\">''-</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3773-helur","name":"Helur","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3773_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"352"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-03T02:57:11-07:00","id":1251003,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Helur</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1131020-night-horrors-shunned-by-the-moon?p=1251001#post1251001\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So basically Gifts lists are updated and we will see more merits, and everything could be added to the creation rules from dark eras right?<br /> That's nice.<br /> Can't wait to see the art notes from Mike and start to work on them.</div> </div> </div> </div>I can\u2019t quite tell if your tone is playing stra