"key":"Posts:","value":"1880"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-12T16:33:02-07:00","id":1253738,"title":"","content":"I saw this question regarding the Promethean Night Horrors and while I initially dismissed it, I figure why not.<br /> <br /> What's the most powerful antagonist in the book? I'm imagining it's one of the idigam, given that they tend to be dreadful enough to threaten the world.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-12T16:56:13-07:00","id":1253743,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nofather</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1131020-night-horrors-shunned-by-the-moon?p=1253738#post1253738\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I saw this question regarding the Promethean Night Horrors and while I initially dismissed it, I figure why not.<br /> <br /> What's the most powerful antagonist in the book? I'm imagining it's one of the idigam, given that they tend to be dreadful enough to threaten the world.</div> </div> </div> </div>Probably, but I have my fingers crossed for a Werewolf Bodhisattva.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank