tps://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-21T22:39:43-07:00","id":1256373,"title":"","content":"Moi aussi, I also am in saying spirits.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1423-espritdecalmar","name":"espritdecalmar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1423_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"941"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-22T00:39:30-07:00","id":1256385,"title":"","content":"Geryo for me too","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/422-lykas","name":"Lykas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar422_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-22T03:47:01-07:00","id":1256421,"title":"","content":"The Geryo have narrowly won out at the time that I\u2019m back and posting (ie, now).<br /> <br /> So, another excerpt showing giving one reason why they\u2019re not exactly what you\u2019d call \u2018totem material\u2019. Sorry wyrd.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> The transformative horror of the Geryo strain is difficult for a Uratha to hide for long. The transformation begins slowly but accelerates with physical trauma and emotional extremes. Shapeshifting brings a little more than expected with each change as the Uratha\u2019s flesh warps in accordance to the infection as much as the werewolf\u2019s desires. Regeneration misfires, building twisted appendages, extra limbs, fingers, eyes \u2014 even additional heads \u2014 as cells move into overdrive but have lost their template to recognize what damage needs repair. Rages and strong emotion warp the werewolf\u2019s mental processes, reshaping them to more closely match the excesses of the original REDACTED. The transformations range from painful to agonizing and are never pleasant. The constant pain and changing mental states wear away at the Uratha\u2019s stability. Unless the werewolf\u2019s pack \u2014 or some other hunters \u2014 exterminate the infected victim quickly, it is only a matter of time before the madness takes hold and the Distorted begins to hunt its former kind. </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Writer. Developer.</i> <b>World of Darkness</b> | <b>Chronicles of Darkness</b> | <b>The Trinity Continuum</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/156-bunyip","name":"Bunyip","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1880"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-22T04:02:05-07:00","id":1256427,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Bunyip</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1131020-night-horrors-shunned-by-the-moon?p=1