ht--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> There\u2019s more to it than that, it\u2019s just that the Blood Talons have no idea why they are there besides Destroyer Wolf wanting them to hold the city</div> </div> </div> </div>there is more yes. It's just that Fenris Ur is almost as clueless in about what he's looking for as the blood talons","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#b22222\"><b>.</b></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3742-iceblade44","name":"Iceblade44","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"707"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-08T12:28:00-07:00","id":1259641,"title":"","content":"There's some sort of instinctual drive even if he doesn't exactly know what's going on. Though I think Fenris-Ur knows (or theorizes, at least) and just isn't the kind to share his plans with werewolves, especially since it seems like something's been hiding Danu-Ur. But among other things, the Blood Talons are driven to gather ghost wolves and wolf-blooded, which would form the basis of a new tribe.<br /> <br /> It will be interesting to see what comes out of the ghost wolf options. Between those we've already seen it looks like there's a lot of ways to go, possible we'll see some hints of new patrons.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":886,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","user":"nofather","date":". 10-08-2018, 03:35 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:"