cepts/page4\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...concepts/page4</a> Go to post 58 xD)!<br /> <br /> I\u2019m kidding, I\u2019m kidding on that last part... then again if you guys would open the door for me and let me in..XD","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1686-korogra","name":"Korogra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1686_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1310"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-06T13:34:47-08:00","id":1285361,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Primordial newcomer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1131020-night-horrors-shunned-by-the-moon?p=1285356#post1285356\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> if the locust really are in, it should be noted that they and the halaku (and whatever the snakes are called) did not really get a full write up. I bet the locust will have new toys and, since all of then seem to have it, will be receiving a gauntlet power</div> </div> </div> </div>Of course. I was just hoping to see something that wasn\u2019t retained from Predators. They will be fleshed out and given some really cool new tricks, certainly, but there is always that familiarity that will color my perception. Nothing wrong with that, if anything it will make the changes cooler. Buuut.. when crabs and cicadas and other cool things are teased, but then left behind.. I get a little disa